# Training artifacts under logs/ are stored as plain blobs, NOT via Git LFS.
#
# GitHub refuses to upload new LFS objects to a public fork:
#   batch response: @<user> can not upload new objects to public fork
# The root .gitattributes marks *.pt as LFS, so we unset the filter for
# everything in this subtree. Deeper .gitattributes win over the root file.
*.pt -filter -diff -merge -text
